  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add pork cubes and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Remove pork from wok and set aside.",
    "Add sliced onions to wok and cook until caramelized, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add garlic, paprika, and salt to wok and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Return pork to wok and stir to combine with onion mixture.",
    "Add apple cider vinegar, cocoa powder, and brown sugar to wok and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Sprinkle with whole black peppercorns and serve hot."
